# Exclude facebook_scraper's potentially large or sensitive local files
# if they were ever to be present in the source directory during copy.
# The Dockerfile copies ../facebook_scraper explicitly, so this .dockerignore
# primarily affects what's in the task_scheduler's own directory context.
# However, if `COPY . /app/task_scheduler` was used after copying scraper,
# it might re-copy things. The current Dockerfile structure is fine.

